# Per-LP Next.js apps each carry their own .gitignore for build artefacts.
# This top-level ignore catches OS + editor cruft across the whole monorepo.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Tool result spills from CRO Evolution workspace (large MCP outputs cached locally)
**/tool-results/
